# redaction denylist — real secret literals for the #51/#53 backfill gate.
# NEVER commit. Default path that ME_REDACT_DENYLIST_FILE may point at; the
# loader (bootstrap::load_secret_denylist) accepts any path, so a denylist kept
# elsewhere is the caller's responsibility to keep ignored.
.secrets-denylist
